<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    width: 1200px;
    height: 630px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #02050d 0%, #0a1a3a 100%);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 80px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -200px;
    right: -200px;
    width: 700px;
    height: 700px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(34,229,255,.3), transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 90px;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #14f0ff, #8a86ff);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    font-weight: 900;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 42px;
    margin: 0 0 30px;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  p {
    font-size: 26px;
    color: #a9bfdc;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 800px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 60px;
    right: 60px;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #22e5ff;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="glow"></div>
  <div class="badge">PORTFOLIO</div>
  <h1>Rehan</h1>
  <h2>Web Developer</h2>
  <p>I build modern, responsive and interactive web experiences that bring ideas to life.</p>
</body>
</html>